Expand ThunderMine

[en.FOCUS_C12_EXPAND_THUNDERLANES_SMELTING_PLANT_desc]
The high-quality steel produced in the ThunderMine is highly sought after by various nations. Additionally, leveraging the area’s infrastructure and raw material sources, this location presents an excellent opportunity for establishing military industries.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_EXPAND_THUNDERLANES_SMELTING_PLANT]
扩大鸣雷冶炼厂

[zh.FOCUS_C12_EXPAND_THUNDERLANES_SMELTING_PLANT_desc]
雷鸣矿脉一带出产的高品质钢铁受到各国的喜爱，与此同时，依托于这里的基础设施和原料产地，这里将会是一个很好的布局军事工业的地点。

